#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"It looks like this participant is already registered for this event. If you "
"want to change your registration, or you feel that you've received this "
"message in error, please contact the site administrator."
msgstr "Zdi se, da je ta udeleženec že registriran za ta dogodek. Če želite spremeniti prijavo, ali menite, da ste prejeli to sporočilo v zmoti, se obrnite na skrbnika strani."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid "This contact has already been assigned to this event."
msgstr "Ta stik je že bil dodeljen temu dogodku."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"It looks like you are already waitlisted for this event. If you want to "
"change your registration, or you feel that you've received this message in "
"error, please contact the site administrator."
msgstr "Zdi se, da ste že na čakalni listi za ta dogodek. Če želite spremeniti prijavo, ali menite, da ste prejeli to sporočilo v zmoti, se obrnite na skrbnika strani."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"It looks like you are already registered for this event. If you want to "
"change your registration, or you feel that you've received this message in "
"error, please contact the site administrator."
msgstr "Zdi se, da ste že registrirani za ta dogodek. Če želite spremeniti prijavo, ali menite, da ste prejeli to sporočilo v zmoti, se obrnite na skrbnika strani."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid "There is only enough space left on this event for %1 participant(s)."
msgstr "Na dogodku je prostora samo še za %1 udeležencev."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php CRM/Event/Page/EventInfo.php
msgid ""
"The event you requested is currently unavailable (contact the site "
"administrator for assistance)."
msgstr "Dogodek, ki ste ga zahtevali, trenutno ni na voljo (povežite skrbnika spletne strani za pomoč)."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"Online registration is not currently available for this event (contact the "
"site administrator for assistance)."
msgstr "Spletna prijava za ta dogodek trenutno ni na voljo (kontaktni skrbnik spletne strani za pomoč)."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid "Event templates are not meant to be registered."
msgstr "Predloge dogodkov niso namenjene prijavam."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid "Registration for this event begins on %1"
msgstr "Prijava na dogodek se začne %1"

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid "Registration for this event ended on %1"
msgstr "Prijava na dogodek se je končala %1"

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"Participant status has been updated to '%1'. An email has been sent to %2."
msgstr "Status udeleženca je bil posodobljen na „%1\". E- pošta je bila poslana %2."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"This event currently has the maximum number of participants registered (%1)."
" However, you can still override this limit and register additional "
"participants using this form."
msgstr "Ta dogodek ima trenutno največ registriranih udeležencev (%1). Vendar lahko še vedno razveljavite to omejitev in registrirate dodatne udeležence z uporabo tega obrazca."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"There are %2 people currently on the waiting list for this event. You can <a"
" href='%1'>view waitlisted registrations here</a>, or you can continue and "
"register additional participants using this form."
msgstr "Obstajajo %2 trenutno na čakalni listi za ta dogodek. Lahko<a href='%1'>Oglejte si prijave na čakalne liste tukaj</a>, ali lahko nadaljujete in registrirate dodatne udeležence z uporabo tega obrazca."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid "Registration selections changed for %1"
msgstr "Izbire prijave za %1 so bile spremenjene"

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"This event registration can not be transferred or cancelled. Contact the "
"event organizer if you have questions."
msgstr "Te prijave dogodka ni mogoče prenesti ali preklicati. Če imate vprašanja, se obrnite na organizatorja dogodka."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"You cannot transfer or cancel your registration for %1 as you are not "
"currently registered for this event."
msgstr "Ne morete prenesti ali preklicati prijave za %1 saj trenutno niste prijavljeni na ta dogodek."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"Registration for this event cannot be cancelled or transferred %1 than %2 "
"hours %3 the event's start time. Contact the event organizer if you have "
"questions."
msgstr "Prijave za ta dogodek ni mogoče preklicati ali prenesti %1 kot %2 ure %3 se obrnite na organizatorja dogodka, če imate vprašanja."

