"Registration Page and Event Fee configurations."
msgstr "Opozorilo: Brisanje te predloge za dogodek bo tudi izbrisalo povezane nastavitve prijavne strani za dogodek in kotizacij za dogodek."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Delete.tpl
msgid ""
"Warning: Deleting this event will also delete associated Event Registration "
"Page and Event Fee configurations."
msgstr "Opozorilo: brisanje tega dogodka bo izbrisalo tudi pripadajoče nastavitve prijavne strani za dogodek in kotizacije za dogodek."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"This is the title that users will see when they are selecting an event "
"template to clone for a new event. It is <em>not</em> the title of the event"
" itself."
msgstr "To je naslov, ki ga bodo uporabniki videli, ko bodo izbrali predlogo za kloniranje novega dogodka. Je<em>ni</em>naslov samega dogodka."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"You can select an existing Event Template as the basis for the new template "
"you are creating, or you can create the template from scratch."
msgstr "Izberete lahko obstoječo predlogo dogodka kot osnovo za novo predlogo, ki jo ustvarjate, ali pa ustvarite predlogo iz nič."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"You can select a pre-configured Event Template to streamline setting up your"
" new event. The information and configuration settings from the selected "
"template will be automatically copied to this new event. You can then add "
"and modify as needed for this specific event instance. Event templates do "
"NOT store the event date and time - so you will definitely need to set those"
" on this page."
msgstr "Izberete lahko vnaprej nastavljeno predlogo dogodka za racionalizacijo nastavitev vašega novega dogodka. Nastavitve informacij in nastavitev iz izbrane predloge bodo samodejno kopirane na ta novi dogodek. Nato lahko dodate in spremenite, kot je potrebno za ta primer dogodka. Predloge dogodkov NE shranjujejo datuma in časa dogodka - tako boste zagotovo morali nastaviti tiste na tej strani."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"The Role you select here is automatically assigned to people when they "
"register online for this event (usually the default 'Attendee' role)."
msgstr "Vloga, ki jo izberete tukaj, je samodejno dodeljena ljudem, ko se registrirajo na spletu za ta dogodek (običajno privzeta vloga 'Udeleženec')."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"You can also allow people to choose a Role by creating a Profile with the "
"Participant Role field. Then include that Profile when you configure the "
"Online Registration page for this event."
msgstr "Prav tako lahko dovolite ljudem, da izberejo vlogo z ustvarjanjem profila s poljem vloge udeleženca. Nato vključite ta profil, ko nastavite spletno stran prijave za ta dogodek."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"To allow users to see a listing of participants, set this field to 'Name' "
"(list names only), 'Name and Email', or 'Name, Status and Register Date'."
msgstr "Da lahko uporabniki vidijo seznam udeležencev, nastavite to polje na 'Ime' (samo imena seznama), 'Ime in e-pošta' ali 'Ime, Status in datum prijave'."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"You will need to set Access Control permissions to include 'view event "
"participants' for any Roles you want to access this listing."
msgstr "Nastaviti boste morali dovoljenja za nadzor dostopa, da boste lahko vključili 'udeležence dogodka' za vse vloge, do katerih želite dostopati."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"Create links to the listing page by copying the following URL, and adding it"
" to the Event Description below and / or as a menu item or links elsewhere "
"on your site:"
msgstr "Ustvarite povezave na listo tako, da kopirate naslednji URL in ga dodate v opis dogodka spodaj in / ali kot menijsko postavko ali povezave drugje na vaši spletni strani:"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"After adding your event, create links to the listing page by copying the URL"
" provided in the 'Participant Listing' section of the Configure Event page."
msgstr "Potem ko dodate svoj dogodek, ustvarite povezave na listo tako, da kopirate URL, ki je naveden v razdelku » Seznam udeležencev « na strani Nastavi dogodek."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"Then create front-end links to the Participant Listing page using the Menu "
"Manager. Select <strong>Participant Listing Page</strong> and enter "
"<strong>%1</strong> for the Event ID."
msgstr "Nato ustvarite povezave na stran za vpis udeleženca z uporabo upravitelja menija. Izberite<strong>Stran za vpis udeležencev</strong>in vstopi<strong>%1</strong>za ID dogodka."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid "Optionally set a maximum number of participants for this event."
msgstr "Neobvezno nastavite največje število udeležencev za ta dogodek."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"You may allow users to join a waitlist when the event is full (by checking "
"the box below)."
msgstr "Uporabnikom lahko dovolite, da se pridružijo čakalnemu seznamu, ko je dogodek poln (s preverjanjem polja spodaj)."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"You may allow users to join a waitlist when the event is full. To enable "
"this feature you must first enable the Participant Statuses used by the "
"waitlist work-flow (click the wrench icon, or navigate to Administer » "
"CiviEvent » Participant Statuses). Then reload this form and check 'Offer a "
"Waitlist?'."
msgstr "Uporabnikom lahko dovolite, da se pridružijo čakalnemu seznamu, ko je dogodek poln. Da bi omogočili to možnost, morate najprej omogočiti statuse udeleženca, ki jih uporablja delovni tok čakalnega seznama (kliknite na ikono ključa ali navigirajte na Administratorja » CiviEvent » Statuse udeleženca). Nato ponovno naložite ta obrazec in preverite 'Offer a Waitlist?'."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"Otherwise, the registration link is hidden and the &quot;Event Full "
"Message&quot' is displayed when the maximum number of registrations is "
"reached. Only participants with status types marked as 'counted' are "
"included when checking if the event is full."
msgstr "V nasprotnem primeru je prijavska povezava skrita in&quot;Celotno sporočilo & quot; dogodka je prikazano, ko je doseženo največje število prijav. Pri preverjanju, ali je dogodek poln, so vključeni samo udeleženci s statusnimi tipi, označenimi kot 'prešteto'."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"Text displayed on the Event Information page when the maximum number of "
"registrations is reached (unless you are offering a waitlist). If online "
"registration is enabled, this message will also be displayed if users "
"attempt to register."
msgstr "Besedilo, prikazano na strani Informacije o dogodku, ko je doseženo največje število prijav (razen če ponujate čakalni seznam). Če je omogočena spletna prijava, bo to sporočilo prikazano tudi, če se bodo uporabniki poskušali registrirati."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box to allow users to join a waitlist if the event is full. If a "
"space becomes available, the first participant from the waitlist will move "
"to 'Pending from waitlist' status, and will be sent an email with a link to "
"complete their registration (including paying event fees - if any)."
msgstr "Omogočite to možnost, da se bodo uporabniki lahko vpisali na čakalni seznam, če bo dogodek poln. Če bo na voljo prostor, se bo prvi udeleženec s čakalnega seznama preselil v status 'Spusti s čakalnega seznama' in bo poslano sporočilo s povezavo za popolno prijavo (vključno s plačilom kotizacij za dogodke - če obstajajo)."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"This message is displayed on the event information and event registration "
"pages when the event is full AND the waitlist feature is enabled."
msgstr "To sporočilo je prikazano na straneh za prijavo dogodka in dogodka, ko je dogodek poln, in funkcija čakalnega seznama je omogočena."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"Include map presenting event location on event information page? (A map "
"provider must be configured under <a href='%1'>Administer > System Settings "
"> Mapping and Geocoding</a>)"
msgstr "Vključite zemljevid, ki prikazuje lokacijo dogodka na strani z informacijami o dogodkih? (Ponudnik zemljevida mora biti nastavljen pod<a href='%1'>Administracija > Sistemske nastavitve > Kartiranje in geokodiranje</a>)"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"Displays links to download an iCal file with the event information, as well "
"as a link to add to Google Calendar. The links will be displayed on the "
"event information page, as well as on the thank-you page and in the email "
"receipt."
msgstr "Prikaže povezave za prenos datoteke iCal z informacijami o dogodkih, pa tudi povezavo za dodajanje na Google Calendar. Povezave bodo prikazane na strani z informacijami o dogodkih, kot tudi na zahvalni strani in v e-pošti."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"Enables the Event Information page, which also allows access to Event "
"Registration (if registrations are open)."
msgstr "Omogoča stran Informacije o dogodku, ki omogoča tudi dostop do prijave dogodka (če so prijave odprte)."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"When enabled, this event will be included in iCalendar feeds and displayed "
"on your site's <a %1>Upcoming Events</a> block."
msgstr "Ko je omogočeno, bo ta dogodek vključen v vire iCalendar in prikazan na vaši spletni strani<a %1>Prihajajoči dogodki</a>blok."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"When enabled, links helping people share this event with their social "
"network will be displayed (e.g. Facebook, Twitter, LinkedIn and email)."
msgstr "Ko bo omogočeno, bodo prikazane povezave, ki pomagajo ljudem deliti ta dogodek s svojim socialnim omrežjem (npr. Facebook, Twitter, LinkedIn in e-pošta)."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.hlp
msgid ""
"Social media links will be included on the Event Info page, Thank-you page, "
"Tell-a-Friend page (if enabled), and in event confirmation emails."
msgstr "Družabne povezave bodo vključene na stran Info dogodka, Hvala stran, Tell-a-Friend stran (če je omogočena) in v e-poštna sporočila za potrditev dogodka."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.tpl
msgid "Edit Participant Status Options"
msgstr "Uredi možnosti stanja udeleženca"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.tpl
msgid "Display event information:"
msgstr "Prikaži informacije o dogodku:"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.tpl
msgid ""
"When this Event is active, create links to the Event Information page by "
"copying and pasting the following URL:"
msgstr "Ko je ta dogodek aktiven, ustvarite povezave do strani z informacijami o dogodku, tako da kopirate in prilepite naslednji URL:"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.tpl
msgid ""
"When this Event is active, create front-end links to the Event Information "
"page using the Menu Manager. Select <strong>Event Info Page</strong> and "
"enter <strong>%1</strong> for the Event ID."
msgstr "Ko je ta dogodek aktiven, ustvarite povezave na stran Informacije o dogodku z uporabo upravljalnika menija. Izberite<strong>Stran z informacijami o dogodku</strong>in vstopi<strong>%1</strong>za ID dogodka."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Fee.hlp
msgid ""
"If this is a paid event and you want users to be able to register and pay "
"online, select a payment processor to use."
msgstr "Če je to plačan dogodek in želite, da se uporabniki lahko registrirajo in plačajo na spletu, izberite ponudnik plačilnih storitev za uporabo."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Fee.hlp
msgid ""
"NOTE: Alternatively, you can enable the <strong>Pay Later</strong> feature "
"below without setting up a payment processor. All users will then be asked "
"to submit payment offline (e.g. mail in a check, call in a credit card, "
"etc.)."
msgstr "OPOMBA: Alternativno lahko omogočite<strong>Plačaj kasneje</strong>spodaj brez nastavljanja plačilnega procesorja. Vsi uporabniki bodo nato pozvani, da predložijo plačilo brez povezave (npr. pošta v čeku, klic s kreditno kartico itd.)."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Fee.hlp
msgid ""
"Text displayed next to the checkbox for the 'pay later' option on the "
"contribution form. You may include HTML formatting tags."
msgstr "Besedilo, prikazano poleg potrditvenega polja za možnost » plačaj kasneje « na obrazcu za prispevek. Lahko vključite HTML formatiranje značk."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Fee.hlp
msgid ""
"This financial type will be assigned to payments made by participants when "
"they register online. If using a price set below note that the contribution "
"record will have this financial type, however line items will be processed "
"using the actual financial type selected for the price set item."
msgstr "Ta finančna vrsta bo dodeljena za plačila, ki jih udeleženci, ko se registrirajo na spletu. Če z uporabo cene, ki je določena spodaj, ugotovite, da bo imela evidenca prispevkov to finančno vrsto, vendar pa se bodo vrstične postavke obdelale z uporabo dejanske finančne vrste, izbrane za cenovno določeno postavko."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Fee.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want to offer discounted fees based on registration "
"date (e.g. 'early-registration discounts')."
msgstr "Omogočite to možnost, če želite ponuditi diskontirane kotizacije na podlagi datuma prijave (npr. 'popusti za zgodnjo prijavo')."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Fee.tpl
msgid ""
"No Payment Processor has been configured / enabled for your site. If this is"
" a <strong>paid event</strong> AND you want users to be able to "
"<strong>register and pay online</strong>, you will need to <a "
"href='%1'>configure a Payment Processor</a> first. Then return to this "
"screen and assign the processor to this event."
msgstr "Ni bil nastavljen / omogočen ponudnik plačilnih storitev za vašo spletno stran. Če je to a<strong>plačani dogodek</strong>IN vi želite, da uporabniki lahko<strong>registrirati in plačati na spletu</strong>, boste morali<a href='%1'>nastavite ponudnik plačilnih storitev</a>najprej. Nato se vrnite na ta zaslon in dodelite procesor za ta dogodek."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Fee.tpl
msgid ""
"Select a Price Set to offer multiple individually priced options for event "
"registrants. Otherwise, leave this empty and enter fixed fee levels below."
msgstr "Izberite ceno Set ponuditi več individualno ceno možnosti za prijavske zavezance za dogodke. V nasprotnem primeru pustite to prazno in vnesite fiksne ravni kotizacije spodaj."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Fee.tpl
msgid "Regular Fees"
msgstr "Redne kotizacije"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Fee.tpl
msgid ""
"Use the table below to enter descriptive labels and amounts for up to ten "
"event fee levels. These will be presented as a list of radio button options."
" Both the label and dollar amount will be displayed. You can also configure "
"one or more sets of discounted fees by checking \"Discounts by Signup Date\""
" below."
msgstr "Uporabite spodnjo tabelo za vnos opisnih oznak in zneskov za do deset ravni kotizacij za dogodke. Ti bodo predstavljeni kot seznam možnosti radijskega gumba. Prikazana bosta tako oznaka kot znesek dolarja. Nastavite lahko tudi enega ali več nizov diskontiranih kotizacij s preverjanjem » Discounts by Signup Date «."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Fee.tpl
msgid ""
"Click <a id='quickconfig' href='#'>here</a> if you want to configure the "
"Regular Fees below as part of a Price Set, with the added flexibility and "
"complexity that entails."
msgstr "Klik<a id='quickconfig' href='#'>Tukaj.</a>če želite nastaviti Redne kotizacije spodaj kot del cene Set, z dodatno prilagodljivostjo in kompleksnost, ki vključuje."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Fee.tpl
msgid "remove discount set"
msgstr "odstrani niz popustov"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Fee.tpl
msgid "another discount set"
msgstr "drug niz popustov"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Fee.tpl
msgid "Discounted Fees"
msgstr "Diskontirane kotizacije"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Fee.tpl
msgid ""
"If you uncheck \"Discounts by Signup Date\" and Save this form, any existing"
" discount sets will be deleted."
msgstr "Če odkljukate \"Popusti po datumu prijave\" in shranite ta obrazec, bodo vsi obstoječi nabori popustov izbrisani."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Fee.tpl
msgid ""
"If this is NOT what you want to do, you can check \"Discounts by Signup "
"Date\" again."
msgstr "Če to ni tisto, kar želite storiti, lahko ponovno preverite » Discounts by Signup Date «."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Location.hlp
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, the location will be shown in various places including:\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"      <li>Event information page</li>\n"
"      <li>Event registration confirmation emails</li>\n"
"      <li>HTML, RSS and ICALENDAR feeds of event information</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"  Normally location information is made publicly available.  By deselecting this box, the location is only available to event administrators."
msgstr "Če je izbrana ta možnost, bo lokacija prikazana na različnih mestih, vključno z:<ul>\n      <li>Stran z informacijami o dogodku</li>\n      <li>E- pošta za potrditev prijave dogodka</li>\n      <li>HTML, RSS in ICalendar virov informacij o dogodkih</li>\n    </ul>Običajno so informacije o lokaciji javno dostopne. S tem, ko je ta možnost odvzeta, je lokacija na voljo samo skrbnikom dogodkov."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Location.hlp
msgid ""
"Note that if 'Show Location' is not set a map will not be shown, regardless "
"of the setting of 'Include Map to Event Location'."
msgstr "Upoštevajte, da če 'Prikaži lokacijo' ni nastavljen zemljevid ne bo prikazan, ne glede na nastavitev 'Vključi zemljevid do lokacije dogodka'."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Location.tpl
msgid ""
"Use this form to configure the location and optional contact information for"
" the event. This information will be displayed on the Event Information "
"page. It will also be included in online registration pages and confirmation"
" emails if these features are enabled."
msgstr "Uporabite ta obrazec za nastavitev lokacije in neobveznih kontaktnih podatkov za dogodek. Ta informacija bo prikazana na strani z informacijami o dogodku. Vključena bo tudi v spletne strani za prijavo in potrditvena sporočila, če bodo te funkcije omogočene."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Location.tpl
msgid ""
"This location is used by %1 other events. Modifying location information "
"will change values for all events."
msgstr "To lokacijo uporablja %1 drugi dogodki. Spreminjanje informacij o lokaciji bo spremenilo vrednosti za vse dogodke."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Location.tpl
msgid ""
"This location is used by %1 other event. Modifying location information will"
" also change values for that event."
msgstr "To lokacijo uporablja %1 drugi dogodki. Spreminjanje informacij o lokaciji bo spremenilo tudi vrednosti za ta dogodek."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"If you want to provide an Online Registration page for this event, check the"
" first box below and then complete the fields on this form. You can offer "
"online registration for both Paid and Free events. Paid events require that "
"you have configured a <a href=\"%1\">payment processor</a> for your site."
msgstr "Če želite zagotoviti spletno stran prijave za ta dogodek, preverite prvo polje spodaj in nato izpolnite polja na tem obrazcu. Lahko ponudite spletno prijavo za tako plačane kot brezplačne dogodke. Plačani dogodki zahtevajo, da ste nastavili<a href=\"%1\">obdelovalec plačil</a>za vašo spletno stran."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"You may also configure events to require administrative approval prior to "
"participants completing the registration process. To enable this feature you"
" must first enable the Participant Statuses used by the approval work-flow "
"(Administer » CiviEvent » Participant Statuses). Then reload this form and "
"check 'Require participant approval?'."
msgstr "Prav tako lahko nastavite dogodke, ki zahtevajo upravno odobritev pred udeleženci, ki zaključijo postopek prijave. Da bi omogočili to funkcijo, morate najprej omogočiti statuse udeleženca, ki jih uporablja postopek odobritve (Administer » CiviEvent » Statuse udeleženca). Nato ponovno naložite ta obrazec in preverite \"Zahtevajte odobritev udeleženca?\"."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"If you want collect additional information during event registration, you "
"will need to configure one or more CiviCRM Profiles - which are collections "
"of standard or custom fields. For event registration, you often want to "
"collect an email address and / or participants' first and last names. You "
"may also need to collect additional information specific to a person's "
"<strong>participation</strong> in an Event. Examples include meal and/or "
"volunteer preferences."
msgstr "Če želite zbrati dodatne informacije med prijavo dogodka, boste morali nastaviti enega ali več profilov CiviCRM - ki so zbirke standardnih ali po meri polj. Za prijavo dogodkov, pogosto želite zbrati e-poštni naslov in / ali prvo in priimek udeležencev. Morda boste morali zbrati tudi dodatne informacije, specifične za osebo je<strong>sodelovanje</strong>na dogodku. Primeri vključujejo izbiro obroka in/ali prostovoljca."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"If you haven't already configured custom fields and a profile for this, you "
"can save this screen without selecting a Profile, complete the steps below "
"and then return to <strong>Manage Events</strong> and select your new "
"profile."
msgstr "Če še niste nastavili polj po meri in profila za to, lahko ta zaslon shranite brez izbire profila, končate korake spodaj in se nato vrnete na<strong>Upravljaj dogodke</strong>in izberite nov profil."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"Create a custom field group which is 'Used for' "
"<strong>Participants</strong>."
msgstr "Ustvari skupino polja po meri, ki je » Uporabno za «<strong>Udeleženci</strong>."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid "Add your field(s) this custom field group."
msgstr "Dodajte polja tej skupini polj po meri."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid "Create a profile (e.g. 'Participant Information')."
msgstr "Ustvari profil (npr. 'informacije o udeležencih')."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid "Add your custom field(s) to this profile as profile fields."
msgstr "Dodajte svoja polja v ta profil kot profilna polja."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"Return to this screen (<strong>Administer CiviCRM &raquo; CiviEvent &raquo; "
"Manage Events &raquo; Configure &raquo; Online Registration</strong>) and "
"select your profile."
msgstr "Vrni se na ta zaslon (<strong>Dajanje zdravila CiviCRM&raquo;CiviEvent&raquo;Upravljaj dogodke&raquo;Nastavi&raquo;Spletna prijava</strong>) in izberite svoj profil."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"Display text for link from Event Information to Event Registration pages "
"(e.g. 'Register Now!')."
msgstr "Prikaži besedilo za povezavo od obvestila o dogodku do strani za prijavo dogodka (npr. 'Register zdaj!')."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box to allow users to register themselves AND additional "
"participants for an event. When this feature is enabled, users have the "
"option to specify the number of additional participants they are registering"
" for. If this is a paid event, they can select a different event fee for "
"each participant and will be charged the total of those fees. If a profile "
"is included, they will complete the profile information for each "
"participant."
msgstr "Omogočite to možnost, da se uporabniki lahko registrirajo in dodatne udeležence za dogodek. Ko je ta možnost omogočena, imajo uporabniki možnost, da določijo število dodatnih udeležencev, za katere se registrirajo. Če je to plačan dogodek, lahko za vsakega udeleženca izberejo drugačno kotizacijo za dogodek in bodo zaračunani celotni stroški. Če je vključen profil, bodo dopolnili informacije o profilu za vsakega udeleženca."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"You can use different profile for the person who is registering than for "
"\"Additional Participants\". For example, you may want to require an email "
"address from the person entering the registration while not requiring (or "
"even requesting) emails for additional participants (i.e. their \"guests\")."
msgstr "Lahko uporabite drugačen profil za osebo, ki se registrira kot za \"Dodatne udeležence\". Na primer, lahko zahtevate e-poštni naslov od osebe, ki vnese prijavo, medtem ko ne zahteva (ali zahteva) e-pošte za dodatne udeležence (tj. njihove \"gosti\")."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"Limit the number of additional participants that can be registered in a "
"single booking."
msgstr "Omeji število dodatnih udeležencev, ki se lahko registrirajo v eni sami rezervaciji."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"Eg: if you choose '2' then the lead booker can bring 2 guests; there would "
"be a limit of 3 participants in total per booking."
msgstr "Eg: če izberete '2', potem lahko vodilni booker prinese 2 gosta; v skupni rezervaciji bi bila omejitev 3 udeleženci."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box to allow a user to register multiple participants using the "
"same email address. Alternatively, if you want additional participants to be"
" registered <strong>without requiring an email address to be entered for "
"each person</strong> - check the \"Register multiple participants\" option, "
"AND include a profile in this registration form which <strong>includes First"
" Name and Last Name fields</strong>."
msgstr "Omogočite to možnost, da lahko uporabnik registrira več udeležencev z istim e-poštnim naslovom. Alternativno, če želite, da se registrirajo dodatni udeleženci<strong>brez zahteve po vnosu e- poštnega naslova za vsako osebo</strong>- preverite možnost \"Register več udeležencev\" IN vključite profil v tem prijavnem obrazcu, ki<strong>vključuje polja z imenom in priimkom</strong>."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"Checking this box will also allow the <strong>same contact to register for "
"this event multiple times</strong>, which is otherwise not possible."
msgstr "Preverjanje tega polja bo omogočilo tudi<strong>isti stik za prijavo za ta dogodek večkrat</strong>, ki sicer ni mogoče."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"By default, your event will use the Unsupervised duplicate matching rule to "
"match participants in anonymous registrations with existing individuals. You"
" may select another rule to use for this event instead. Make sure that your "
"included profile(s) contain the fields needed by your matching rule."
msgstr "Privzeto bo vaš dogodek uporabil nenadzorovano podvojeno pravilo za ujemanje udeležencev v anonimnih prijavah z obstoječimi posamezniki. Namesto tega lahko izberete drugo pravilo za ta dogodek. Prepričajte se, da vaši vključeni profili vsebujejo polja, ki so potrebna po vašem pravilu za ujemanje."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box to require administrative approval for all the participants "
"who self-register, prior to being able to complete the registration process."
" Participants will be placed in 'Awaiting Approval' status. You can review "
"and approve participants from 'Find Participants' - select the 'Participant "
"status - change' task. Approved participants will move to 'Pending from "
"approval' status, and will be sent an email with a link to complete their "
"registration (including paying event fees - if any). "
msgstr "Omogočite to možnost, da zahtevate upravno odobritev za vse udeležence, ki se registrirajo, preden lahko zaključijo postopek prijave. Udeleženci bodo uvrščeni v status 'Čakanje na odobritev'. Udeležence lahko pregledate in odobrite s 'Poišči udeležence' - izberite nalogo 'Status udeleženca - sprememba'. Odobreni udeleženci bodo prešli na status 'V postopku odobritve' in poslali vam bodo e-pošto s povezavo za dokončanje prijave (vključno s plačilom kotizacij za dogodke - če obstajajo). "

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"Time limit <strong>in hours</strong> for confirming/finishing registration "
"by participants with any of the pending statuses. Enter 0 (or leave empty) "
"to disable this feature."
msgstr "Rok<strong>v urah</strong>za potrditev/dokončanje prijave s strani udeležencev s katerim koli od nerešenih statusov. Vnesite 0 (ali pustite prazno), da onemogočite to možnost."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want to allow registered participants to either cancel"
" their registration OR transfer it to another participant. If this feature "
"is enabled, event confirmation emails will include a link to a Cancel or "
"Transfer form."
msgstr "Omogočite to možnost, če želite registriranim udeležencem omogočiti, da bodisi prekličejo prijavo ali jo prenesejo na drugega udeleženca. Če je ta možnost omogočena, bodo sporočila o potrditvi dogodka vključevala povezavo do obrazca Prekliči ali Prenesi."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"<strong>Automated refunds for cancellations are NOT currently "
"supported.</strong> Participants who have paid for an event will be notified"
" that cancellations are not refundable."
msgstr "<strong>Avtomatska nadomestila za preklic trenutno niso podprta.</strong>Udeleženci, ki so plačali za dogodek, bodo obveščeni, da odpovedi niso vrnjene."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"Number of hours prior to event start date to allow self-service cancellation"
" or transfer. Enter a negative number of hours to allow cancellation after "
"the event starts. Enter 0 (or leave empty) to allow cancellation or transfer"
" up until the event has started."
msgstr "Število ur pred začetkom dogodka, da se omogoči samopostrežna odpoved ali prenos. Vnesite negativno število ur, da se omogoči odpoved po začetku dogodka. Vnesite 0 (ali pustite prazno), da se omogoči odpoved ali prenos do začetka dogodka."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"Do you want a registration confirmation email sent automatically to the "
"user? This email includes event date(s), location and contact information. "
"For paid events, this email is also a receipt for their payment."
msgstr "Želite elektronsko potrdilo o prijavi, ki je samodejno poslano uporabniku? To elektronsko sporočilo vključuje datum(-e), lokacijo in kontaktne podatke. Za plačane dogodke je to elektronsko sporočilo tudi potrdilo za njihovo plačilo."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"You can notify event organizers of each online registration by specifying "
"one or more email addresses to receive a carbon copy (cc). Multiple email "
"addresses should be separated by a comma (e.g. jane@example.org, "
"paula@example.org)."
msgstr "Organizatorje dogodkov lahko obvestite o vsaki spletni prijavi tako, da navedete enega ali več e-poštnih naslovov za prejem kopije ogljika (cc). Več e-poštnih naslovov je treba ločiti z vejico (npr. jane@example.org, paula@example.org)."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.hlp
msgid ""
"You may specify one or more email addresses to receive a blind carbon copy "
"(bcc) of the confirmation email. Multiple email addresses should be "
"separated by a comma (e.g. jane@example.org, paula@example.org)."
msgstr "Lahko določite enega ali več e-poštnih naslovov za prejemanje slepe kopije (bcc) potrditvene e-pošte. Več e-poštnih naslovov je treba ločiti z vejico (npr. jane@example.org, paula@example.org)."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.tpl
msgid "remove profile"
msgstr "odstrani profil"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.tpl
msgid "add another profile"
msgstr "dodaj drug profil"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.tpl
msgid ""
"If you want to provide an Online Registration page for this event, check the"
" first box below and then complete the fields on this form."
msgstr "Če želite zagotoviti spletno stran prijave za ta dogodek, preverite prvo polje spodaj in nato izpolnite polja na tem obrazcu."

