msgstr "ID:"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Tab.hlp
msgid "Info &amp; Settings"
msgstr "Podatki&amp;Nastavitve"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Set event title, type (conference, performance etc.), description, start and"
" end dates, maximum number of participants, and activate the event. Enable "
"the public participant listing feature."
msgstr "Nastavite naslov dogodka, vrsto (konferenca, izvedba itd.), opis, datum začetka in konca, največje število udeležencev in aktivirajte dogodek. Omogočite možnost za navajanje javnih udeležencev."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Tab.hlp
msgid "Set event location and event contact information (email and phone)."
msgstr "Nastavite lokacijo dogodka in kontaktne podatke o dogodku (email in telefon)."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Determine if the event is free or paid. For paid events, set the payment "
"processor, fee level(s) and discounts. Give online registrants the option to"
" 'pay later' (e.g. mail in a check, call in a credit card, etc.)."
msgstr "Določite, ali je dogodek brezplačen ali plačan. Za plačane dogodke nastavite ponudnik plačilnih storitev, ravni kotizacij in popustov. Dajte spletnim prijavskim zavezancem možnost, da »plačajo kasneje« (npr. pošta v čeku, klic s kreditno kartico itd.)."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Determine whether an online registration page is available. If so, configure"
" registration, confirmation and thank you page elements and confirmation "
"email details."
msgstr "Določite, ali je spletna stran za prijavo na voljo. Če je tako, nastavite prijavo, potrditev in hvala elemente strani in potrditve e-pošte podrobnosti."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Make it easy for participants to spread the word about this event to friends"
" and colleagues."
msgstr "Udeležencem olajšajte širjenje besede o tem dogodku prijateljem in kolegom."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"The following URL will display a list of registered participants for this "
"event to users whose role includes \"view event participants\" permission: "
"<a href=\"%1\">%1</a>"
msgstr "Naslednji URL bo uporabnikom, katerih vloga vključuje dovoljenje za \"ogled udeležencev dogodka\", prikazal seznam prijavljenih udeležencev za ta dogodek:<a href=\"%1\">%1</a>"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"The following URL will display a list of registered participants for this "
"event: <a href=\"%1\">%1</a>"
msgstr "Naslednji URL bo prikazal seznam registriranih udeležencev za ta dogodek:<a href=\"%1\">%1</a>"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Participant Listing is not enabled for this event. You can enable it from"
msgstr "Udeleženec za ta dogodek ni omogočen. Omogočite mu lahko"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"View the Event Information page as it will be displayed to site visitors."
msgstr "Oglejte si stran z informacijami o dogodku, saj bo prikazana obiskovalcem strani."

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Tab.hlp
msgid "Registration"
msgstr "Prijava"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Tab.hlp
msgid "test-drive"
msgstr "preskusna vožnja"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Test-drive the entire online registration process - including custom fields,"
" confirmation, thank-you page, and receipting. Fee payment transactions will"
" be directed to your payment processor's test server. <strong>No live "
"financial transactions will be submitted. However, a contact record will be "
"created or updated and participant and contribution records will be saved to"
" the database. Use obvious test contact names so you can review and delete "
"these records as needed.</strong>"
msgstr "Test-pogon celoten postopek spletne prijave - vključno po meri polja, potrditev, hvala stran, in prejem. Transakcije plačila kotizacije bodo usmerjeni na testni strežnik vašega plačilnega procesorja.<strong>Ne bodo predložene žive finančne transakcije. Vendar pa se bo ustvaril ali posodobil kontaktni zapis in udeleženci in evidence prispevkov bodo shranjeni v bazo podatkov. Uporabite očitna testna kontaktna imena, tako da lahko pregledate in izbrišete te evidence, kot je potrebno.</strong>"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Tab.hlp
msgid "live"
msgstr "živi"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Tab.hlp
msgid ""
"Review your customized <strong>LIVE</strong> online event registration page "
"here. Use the following URL in links and buttons on any website to send "
"visitors to this live page"
msgstr "Pregledajte po meri<strong>ŽIVI</strong>spletna stran za prijavo dogodkov tukaj. Uporabite naslednji URL v povezavah in gumbih na kateri koli spletni strani poslati obiskovalce na to stran v živo"

#: templates/CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Tab.tpl
